<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM JULY NET RISES TO PLN 8.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM JULY NET RISES TO PLN 8.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.12 vs   1.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	38.27 vs  28.97</p>
<p> Operating loss	 6.29 vs   6.05 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   57.42 vs  80.67</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    24.26 vs  23.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit     111.06 vs 122.87</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.74 vs  25.65</p>
<p> Sales		  480.27 vs 597.22</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial and trading</p>
<p>conglomerate is Elektrim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
